{"task_id": "4e5f1e1db5f5033e", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "Using the product rule via logarithmic differentiation,\n\\[\nf'(-4)=f(-4)\\left(\\frac{5}{-15}+\\frac{-1}{9}+\\frac{3}{-12}+\\frac{-4}{18}\\right).\n\\]\nHere,\n\\[\nf(-4)=(-15)(9)(-12)(18)=29160,\n\\]\nand\n\\[\n\\frac{5}{-15}+\\frac{-1}{9}+\\frac{3}{-12}+\\frac{-4}{18}\n=-\\frac{11}{12}.\n\\]\nTherefore,\n\\[\nf'(-4)=29160\\left(-\\frac{11}{12}\\right)=-26730.\n\\]\n\n{\"answer\":\"-26730\"}", "parsed_answer": "-26730", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 4112, "usage": {"input": 264, "output": 344, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 180, "totalTokens": 608, "cost": {"input": 5.28e-05, "output": 0.0004128, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0004656}}, "cost_usd": 0.0004656, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "low", "responseId": "resp_0f1470e34878f9ba016ad39cb5e24487d29c3de0e5069ac520"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:05:08+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:05:12+00:00"}
