{"task_id": "acf03d9cf5b82cdc", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "At \\(x=-1\\), the factor product is\n\\[\nf(-1)=(-4)(5)(3)(1)(11)(-2)=1320.\n\\]\nUsing the logarithmic derivative,\n\\[\n\\frac{f'(-1)}{f(-1)}\n=\\frac{6}{-4}+\\frac{-6}{5}+\\frac{-3}{3}+\\frac{-4}{1}+\\frac{-5}{11}+\\frac{9}{-2}\n=-\\frac{696}{55}.\n\\]\nThus,\n\\[\nf'(-1)=1320\\left(-\\frac{696}{55}\\right)=-16704.\n\\]\n\n{\"answer\":\"-16704\"}", "parsed_answer": "-16704", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 4561, "usage": {"input": 279, "output": 447, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 293, "totalTokens": 726, "cost": {"input": 5.580000000000001e-05, "output": 0.0005364, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0005922000000000001}}, "cost_usd": 0.0005922000000000001, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "low", "responseId": "resp_02ce11d99db25936016ad39cb9c8a087d2a2e26561138a02cb"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:05:12+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:05:17+00:00"}
