{"task_id": "7e1d5aed4b26834e", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "Subtracting the first equation from the third gives:\n\\[\n5x_2+3x_3+6x_4=22.\n\\]\n\nUsing the first equation to eliminate \\(x_1\\) from the fourth gives:\n\\[\n13x_2+4x_3+18x_4=41.\n\\]\n\nTogether with\n\\[\n-2x_2+5x_3-x_4=7,\n\\]\nsolving yields:\n\\[\nx_2=5,\\quad x_3=3,\\quad x_4=-2.\n\\]\n\nSubstituting into the first equation gives \\(x_1=-5\\).\n\n{\"answer\": [-5, 5, 3, -2]}", "parsed_answer": "[-5, 5, 3, -2]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 6732, "usage": {"input": 320, "output": 613, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 456, "totalTokens": 933, "cost": {"input": 6.400000000000001e-05, "output": 0.0007356, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0007996}}, "cost_usd": 0.0007996, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "low", "responseId": "resp_0ebbfde6779b8860016ad39cb9865087d29eccc02d4a168746"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:05:12+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:05:19+00:00"}
