{"task_id": "ab8df6491b4c8af0", "model_key": "openai-gpt-5-6-luna", "raw_response": "Since \\(1000003\\) is prime, reduce the exponent modulo \\(1000002\\):\n\\[\n10^{10}\\equiv (10^6)(10^4)\\equiv (-2)(10000)\\equiv 980002\\pmod{1000002}.\n\\]\nThus\n\\[\n2^{10^{10}}\\equiv 2^{980002}=2^{-20000}\\pmod{1000003}.\n\\]\nRepeated squaring gives\n\\[\n2^{20000}\\equiv 8054\\pmod{1000003}.\n\\]\nThe modular inverse of \\(8054\\) modulo \\(1000003\\) is \\(514156\\), so the required residue is \\(514156\\).\n\n{\"answer\":\"514156\"}", "parsed_answer": "514156", "correct": false, "parse_status": "wrong", "error": null, "latency_ms": 19790, "usage": {"input": 290, "output": 2164, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 2001, "totalTokens": 2454, "cost": {"input": 5.800000000000001e-05, "output": 0.0025968, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0026547999999999997}}, "cost_usd": 0.0026547999999999997, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "low", "responseId": "resp_0188717741edd034016ad39cb9cdd887d2b833e1ce787a09eb"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:05:12+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:05:32+00:00"}
